cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "eQc - Easy Qual Coding"
abstract: >-
  eQc is a local desktop application for qualitative research. It imports
  interviews, field notes, documents and images; codes passages and regions;
  organises a codebook with definitions and summaries; links memos to evidence;
  and supports cases, groups, retrieval queries and recovery history. Analysis
  includes frequencies, co-occurrence matrices, framework analysis, text search,
  intercoder reliability and consensus. A visualization workspace provides
  seventeen diagram types with editable figures. Project data stays on the local
  computer, with no account or cloud upload required.
type: software
